{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you have to kill giants to collect their core. To do that, you can build huge walking fortresses and attach weapons on them.\u00a0 <br>To power these fortresses, you need to craft energy cubes, keep in mind the enemies wont let you get the materials without a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Walking fortress</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your base to allow it to walk or even fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/walk_5.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Giant bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of these bosses can only be defeated with a base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/16_titan_spawn.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Explore</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your time to explore the vast world of Loya!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/5_pan_floating_island.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Defenses</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add defenses to your base by placing towers that automatically attack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/combat.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Building</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to make your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/14_build.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends in friend only games or join a dedicated server! The servers are optimized to handle up to 25 players! (It could handle more but I never tested it) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Other features</u></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles with procedural rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capturable/Mountable pets</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2271150?t=1750552039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/99305e87284e15e13360df72660d1cbb69b4d40f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750552039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/f7d6c3e809184a27f57b9a0b60090a628a3f4021/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750552039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/f7d6c3e809184a27f57b9a0b60090a628a3f4021/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750552039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you have to kill giants to collect their core. To do that, you can build huge walking fortresses and attach weapons on them.\u00a0 <br>To power these fortresses, you need to craft energy cubes, keep in mind the enemies wont let you get the materials without a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Walking fortress</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your base to allow it to walk or even fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/walk_5.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Giant bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of these bosses can only be defeated with a base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/16_titan_spawn.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Explore</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your time to explore the vast world of Loya!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/5_pan_floating_island.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Defenses</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add defenses to your base by placing towers that automatically attack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/combat.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Building</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to make your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/extras/14_build.gif?t=1750552039\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends in friend only games or join a dedicated server! The servers are optimized to handle up to 25 players! (It could handle more but I never tested it) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Other features</u></strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles with procedural rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caves</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capturable/Mountable pets</p></li></ul>","developers":["Joyen"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2271150/98c8ba14f9d463e95fc03717b4dfd6f0dce9be5b/header.jpg?t=1750552039","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256939962,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256939962/movie480.mp4?t=1748782067","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256939962/movie_max.mp4?t=1748782067"},"name":"Official trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256939962/68caf83763f9bf4c6b877835a3a254d2e63e09b7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748782067","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256939962/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748782067","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256939962/movie_ma